  "version": "0.7.0-alpha.6",
  "notes": "## 0.7.0-alpha.6 - 2026-05-08\n\n### Features\n\n- Mobile Sync setup now shows separate iOS and Android instructions and credentials for compatible mobile clients.\n- Paired mobile devices now show their login username and can get a new password without removing and adding the device again.\n- The iOS Shortcut install QR code and link now point to the latest compatible shortcut.\n- Paired desktops now return to Online sooner when they reconnect, while unreachable devices are checked less aggressively.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Images sent from mobile clients now arrive as images even when the client does not provide a specific image type.\n- Incoming clipboard items no longer leave a stuck receiving placeholder after the content has arrived.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.7.0-alpha.6 - 2026-05-08\n\n### Features\n\n- 移动设备同步设置现在分别展示 iOS 和安卓接入说明，并提供兼容移动客户端可用的凭据。\n- 已配对的移动设备现在会显示登录用户名，并且无需删除后重加即可生成新密码。\n- iOS 快捷指令安装二维码和链接现在指向最新的兼容快捷指令。\n- 已配对桌面设备重新上线时会更快恢复为在线状态，同时减少对不可达设备的重复检查。\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 从移动客户端发送的图片即使缺少明确图片类型，也会作为图片写入桌面剪贴板。\n- 传入的剪贴板内容到达后，不再留下卡住的“正在接收”占位卡片。",
